-- EVT menu_assemble (plain Lua 5.2 source). Base: new file (no retail original). Grafts in order: rogue_bank. Generated by research/scripts/menu_assemble.py from research/grafts/; do not edit by hand.
-- evt_rogue_bank_menu (plain Lua 5.2 source, Expanded Victory Tool, INAROGUE step 1: "Banco de jugadores").
-- Opened by evt_inarogue_menu ("Banco de jugadores") as a child menu. Built by research/scripts/rogue_build.py;
-- every "1579384326" below is replaced by crc32(name). Design: docs/game/inarogue.md §8.
-- v2 screen (2026-09-24 in-game feedback: a card grid instead of text rows):
--   team00_01_chara_card_for_list x13  = 12 grid cards (4 x 3, locators of the cloned save01_03 layout) + the panel card
--   evt_rogue_mark x13                 = clone of cmn01_10_new_icon, attached by the window objbin to the TOP-LEFT
--                                        of every card (_atc_evt_rogue_markNN): the "N★" rarity mark
-- v3 (user requests): no level text and no player name on the cards; N★ top-left; element + position icons stay.
-- No "Retirar": the goal is to collect every character, so a player never leaves the bank.
-- The bank holds up to 6000 players (one per character): entries are read lazily, one screen at a time
-- (CMND_EVT_RL_BANK_GET reads a cached sort order in the loader).
-- PICK MODE (run start, PokeRogue style, docs/game/inarogue.md §12): opened by INAROGUE "Empezar" with the parameter
-- crc32("evt_rogue_bank_mode") = 1. Enter picks / unpicks a player (starter cost by rarity, lowered by fragments),
-- the guide line counts the squad and the budget, F3 "Empezar" starts the run with the 11 picked players (result 1).
-- SLOT MODE (the team screen, §12.1b): opened by evt_rogue_team_menu with evt_rogue_bank_mode = 2 and the slot in
-- evt_rogue_bank_slot (+ its position in evt_rogue_bank_pos). Cards show their cost for that slot; players that do not
-- fit the points left are greyed; Enter puts the player in the slot (CMND_EVT_RL_TEAM_SET) and closes (result 1).
-- ALBUM MODE (docs/game/modes/inarogue.md §14, 2026-09-28: "el álbum debe ser el banco de jugadores"): opened by the
-- INAROGUE row "Álbum" with evt_rogue_bank_mode = 3. The same grid lists EVERY collectible card of the game
-- (CMND_EVT_RL_ALBUM_INFO op 3/4, album_data.rs: ~5,000 cards by original team). Owned cards (the bank holds any row of
-- that character) look as in the bank; missing ones are greyed, without face / element / position, named "???", and
-- the panel hides their data. Tab = order (Equipo / Rareza / Faltan), L1/R1 (Z/C) = page, L2/R2 (Q/E) = team.
-- PAGING (every mode): L1/R1 are polled in Step() with CMND_CHECK_INPUT_CMD(MENU_CTRL, ...), no setting change.
--   save01_04_savedata_detail_window   = the player panel (tier strip, card on the chronicle picture, cost / budget)
--   save01_02_list_item x1             = the INPUT ANCHOR (off screen): keeps the engine focus, so Enter / Back /
--                                        function keys arrive as retail; arrows arrive as OnFunction ids (setting)
-- The card backgrounds are swapped to the tier plates (evt_rogue_card_base/color_NN, the same sprite swap the
-- position-cards graft uses for coach cards). Data: vr-loader module `rogue` (CMND_EVT_RL_*).
-- Rule (position-cards.md §4b): no engine call at top level; funcLuaCommand only exists inside callbacks.
INCLUDE("LUA_PROG_BASE")
INCLUDE("LUA_SAVEDATA_MANAGEMENT_MENU_INC")   -- header helpers (soccer top inc, soccer_common) + general window inc
INCLUDE("LUA_MENU_DEF")
INCLUDE("LUA_SOCCER_FORMATION_MENU_INC")      -- NameSetting_CharaCardForSoccer (card node names; retail seasonal list)

